{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301430","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130143001:1":{"text":"하지만 첫 번째를 통과한 것만으로도 아주 대단한 거예요!","source_cn":"可通过第一个试炼就已经很厉害了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71F9316590127EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130143002:1":{"text":"붉은 거미 지역에서 거미알을 가져왔다면서요? 상단한테서 들었어요!","source_cn":"商队的人说，你们从赤沙蛛域取到了蜘蛛蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36FF8E7C2AEAAFC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130143003:1":{"text":"거긴 거미의 둥지가 있는 곳이라 거미가 셀 수 없을 정도로 많아요... 으윽... 생각만 해도 무서워요!","source_cn":"那里可以蜘蛛的巢穴，有着数不尽的蜘蛛……只是想一想，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B0FF43F577292AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血阿米库":{"text":"아미쿠","source":"小蛮血阿米库","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}